{
  "final_message": "**Status:** Reproduced (on the given revision, 3.5.17; also on the published 3.5.14 and 3.5.17 builds; 3.5.13 renders correctly)\n\n**Expected:** `<SubComponent>` renders the `#_duration` template the parent passed in (\"provided _duration\").\n**Actual:** `#title` renders, but `_duration` falls back to its default content:\n`<div><p>random</p><div>provided title</div><div>default _duration</div></div>`\n\n**Trigger:** A slot whose name starts with `_` is passed to a child component, and that child sits inside a parent's slot when the parent's slots are compiled as DYNAMIC (a sibling `<template v-if ... #randomslotname>`). If I remove the `v-if` (control test), it passes.\n\n**Run:** `npx vitest run --project unit packages/vue/__tests__/underscoreSlotRepro.spec.ts` (needs `pnpm install`). The patch adds only this test file. It uses the full runtime-compiled `vue` build with the reporter's three components inlined. The v-if case fails and the control passes. The failure is deterministic.\n\n**Version check:** Run in jsdom with the reporter's template: vue@3.5.13 OK, 3.5.14 BUG, 3.5.17 BUG.\n\n**Likely cause (not verified by a fix):** Between 3.5.13 and 3.5.14, the filter in `assignSlots` (packages/runtime-core/src/componentSlots.ts:183) changed from `optimized || key !== '_'` to `optimized || !isInternalKey(key)`, in commit 5d166f3 (#13215). `isInternalKey` treats any key starting with `_` as internal. So when the child is mounted non-optimized (here, inside the parent's DYNAMIC slot), user slots like `_duration` aren't copied. That is the only difference in that region of the published 3.5.13 and 3.5.14 builds besides a dev-only warning change.\n\nNo production code was changed.\n",
  "patch": "diff --git a/packages/vue/__tests__/underscoreSlotRepro.spec.ts b/packages/vue/__tests__/underscoreSlotRepro.spec.ts\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..2870de4\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/packages/vue/__tests__/underscoreSlotRepro.spec.ts\n@@ -0,0 +1,59 @@\n+import { createApp } from '../src'\n+\n+// Reproduction for: slot <template> whose name starts with \"_\" falls back to\n+// default content when the child component is a sibling of a conditionally\n+// rendered (v-if) slot template of its parent component (since v3.5.14).\n+const BaseLayout = {\n+  template: `<div><slot name=\"randomslotname\"></slot><slot></slot></div>`,\n+}\n+\n+const SubComponent = {\n+  template: `\n+    <slot name=\"title\"><div>default title</div></slot>\n+    <slot name=\"_duration\"><div>default _duration</div></slot>\n+  `,\n+}\n+\n+function mount(cond: boolean) {\n+  const container = document.createElement('div')\n+  createApp({\n+    components: { BaseLayout, SubComponent },\n+    data: () => ({ cond }),\n+    template: `\n+      <BaseLayout>\n+        <template v-if=\"cond\" #randomslotname><p>random</p></template>\n+        <SubComponent>\n+          <template #title><div>provided title</div></template>\n+          <template #_duration><div>provided _duration</div></template>\n+        </SubComponent>\n+      </BaseLayout>\n+    `,\n+  }).mount(container)\n+  return container.innerHTML\n+}\n+\n+describe('#13611 underscore-prefixed slot name', () => {\n+  it('renders provided _duration slot when sibling of v-if slot template', () => {\n+    const html = mount(true)\n+    expect(html).toContain('provided title')\n+    expect(html).toContain('provided _duration')\n+    expect(html).not.toContain('default _duration')\n+  })\n+\n+  it('control: without v-if on the parent slot template', () => {\n+    const container = document.createElement('div')\n+    createApp({\n+      components: { BaseLayout, SubComponent },\n+      template: `\n+        <BaseLayout>\n+          <template #randomslotname><p>random</p></template>\n+          <SubComponent>\n+            <template #title><div>provided title</div></template>\n+            <template #_duration><div>provided _duration</div></template>\n+          </SubComponent>\n+        </BaseLayout>\n+      `,\n+    }).mount(container)\n+    expect(container.innerHTML).toContain('provided _duration')\n+  })\n+})\n",
  "run_command": "npx vitest run --project unit packages/vue/__tests__/underscoreSlotRepro.spec.ts"
}